Bind series of series of number to first-row, given (the series of series of series of number table):
    Return item 1 of table.
Done.
Define table as a series of series of series of number.
Insert (a series of series of number) into table.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define inner as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Insert inner into cast first-row on (table).
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State table.
